%I A401435 #17 Nov 22 2026 09:59:49
%S A401435 1,8,101,4495,301564,60167097,18762622110
%N A401435 Number of ways to tile an n X n square with rectangles of integer side lengths so that the widths weakly decrease from left to right along every row and the heights weakly decrease from bottom to top along every column.
%e A401435 For n = 2 the a(2) = 8 tilings are:
%e A401435   +---+---+  +---+---+  +---+---+  +---+---+
%e A401435   |       |  |   |   |  |       |  |   |   |
%e A401435   +       +  +   +   +  +---+---+  +---+---+
%e A401435   |       |  |   |   |  |       |  |       |
%e A401435   +---+---+, +---+---+, +---+---+, +---+---+,
%e A401435   +---+---+  +---+---+  +---+---+  +---+---+
%e A401435   |   |   |  |   |   |  |       |  |   |   |
%e A401435   +---+   +  +   +---+  +---+---+  +---+---+
%e A401435   |   |   |  |   |   |  |   |   |  |   |   |
%e A401435   +---+---+, +---+---+, +---+---+, +---+---+.
%e A401435 All 8 tilings of the 2 X 2 square by rectangles qualify; for n = 3, 101 of the 322 tilings of the 3 X 3 square by rectangles qualify.
%Y A401435 Cf. A182275, A402607, A402657.
